  "difficulty": "hard",
  "summary": "Find the shortest chain of words from begin to end, changing one letter at a time.",
  "problem": "Transform beginWord into endWord by changing one letter per step, where every intermediate word is in the word list. Model words as nodes joined when they differ by one letter, then BFS for the shortest chain. Return the number of words in that sequence.",
